<title>SOUTH KOREA: S.Korea Daedong wins $184 mln shipbuilding orders.</title>
<headline>S.Korea Daedong wins $184 mln shipbuilding orders.</headline>
<dateline>SEOUL 1997-06-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>South Korea's Daedong Shipbuilding Co Ltd said on Monday it had won orders worth $184 million from two European shipping companies.</p>
<p>A company statement said a $130 million order for four 45,000-tonne chemical carriers was awarded by Italy's D'Amico and a $54 million order for two 72,700 tonne bulk carriers came in from Swiss shipping firm Suisse Atlantique.</p>
<p>Deliveries to D'Amico would start in early 1999 and the bulk carriers to Suisse Atlantique would be delivered in 1998, it said.</p>
<p>--Seoul Newsroom (822) 727 5643</p>
